<http://dbpedia.org/resource/RCD_Espanyol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reial Club Deportiu Espanyol de Barcelona (Catalan: [rəˈjal ˈklub dəpuɾˈtiw əspəˈɲɔl də βəɾsəˈlonə]; \"Royal Spanish Sports Club of Barcelona\"), commonly known as Espanyol, is a professional sports club based in Cornellà de Llobregat, Spain, that competes in La Liga, the top tier of the Spanish football league system."@en .
