<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Police_Tero_F.C.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Police Tero Football Club (Thai: สโมสรฟุตบอลโปลิศ-เทโร), formerly known as BEC Tero Sasana Football Club, is a Thai professional football club based in Bangkok. The club finished runners-up in the inaugural AFC Champions League competition in 2003. BEC-Tero Sasana merged with Police United in the 2017 season and changed its official name to Police-Tero Football Club in the 2018 season."@en .
