<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Truman_Bulldogs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Truman Bulldogs** are the sports teams of [Truman State University](:Truman_State_University), located in [Kirksville](:Kirksville%2C_Missouri), [Missouri](:Missouri), United States. They participate in the [NCAA](:National_Collegiate_Athletic_Association)'s [Division II](:NCAA_Division_II) and in the [Great Lakes Valley Conference](:Great_Lakes_Valley_Conference) (GLVC), joining the conference in 2013 after having been a member of the [Mid-America Intercollegiate Athletics Association](:Mid-America_Intercollegiate_Athletics_Association) (MIAA) since that league's creation in 1912."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
