<http://dbpedia.org/resource/El_Gouna_FC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El Gouna Football Club (Arabic: نادي الجونة لكرة القدم), is an Egyptian association football club based in El Gouna, Hurghada, Egypt. The club currently plays in the Egyptian Premier League, the highest league in the Egyptian football league system."@en .
