<http://dbpedia.org/resource/FC_Spartak_Vladikavkaz> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "FC Spartak Vladikavkaz (Russian: Футбольный клуб «Спартак Владикавказ») was a Russian football club based in Vladikavkaz (formerly Ordzhonikidze), North Ossetia–Alania. Founded in 1921, the club played in the Soviet Top League during the communist era, and won its first and only league title in the 1995 Russian Top League."@en .
