<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Colchester_United_F.C.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Colchester United Football Club is a professional association football club based in the city of Colchester, Essex, England. The team competes in EFL League Two, the fourth tier of the English football league system. Colchester United play their home games at Colchester Community Stadium in Colchester. They relocated to the stadium in 2008 when they moved away from Layer Road, their home stadium for 71 years."@en .
