<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mohit_Ahlawat_(cricketer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mohit Ahlawat (born 25 December 1995) is an Indian cricketer who plays for Services. On 7 February 2017, Ahlawat became the first player to score a triple century in a twenty-overs match: he made 300 runs in 72 balls in a local T20 match. He made his Twenty20 debut for Services in the 2018–19 Syed Mushtaq Ali Trophy on 21 February 2019. He made his List A debut on 27 September 2019, for Services in the 2019–20 Vijay Hazare Trophy."@en .
