<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tecos_F.C.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tecos Fútbol Club (often referred to by its nickname \"Tecos\") is a Mexican professional football club associated with the Universidad Autónoma de Guadalajara AC. It plays its home games in the Estadio 3 de Marzo (March 3 Stadium, named for the day the university was founded in 1935). The 30,015-seat facility is located in Zapopan, a municipality within the Guadalajara, Jalisco conurbation. In August 2015, the Leaño family announced they had bought the image rights from , thus, re-founding the club to play in the Tercera División, the fourth tier of Mexican football."@en .
