<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oakland_Raiders> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**[National Football League](:National_Football_League) ([1970](:1970_NFL_season)–[2019](:2019_NFL_season%29)**The **Oakland Raiders** were a professional [American football](:American_football) team that played in [Oakland](:Oakland%2C_California) from its founding in [1960](:1960_Oakland_Raiders_season) to [1981](:1981_Oakland_Raiders_season) and again from [1995](:1995_Oakland_Raiders_season) to [2019](:2019_Oakland_Raiders_season) before [relocating](:Oakland_Raiders_relocation_to_Las_Vegas) to the [Las Vegas metropolitan area](:Las_Vegas_Valley). Between [1982](:1982_Los_Angeles_Raiders_season) and [1994](:1994_Los_Angeles_Raiders_season), the team played in [Los Angeles](:Los_Angeles) as the [Los Angeles Raiders](:Los_Angeles_Raiders).The team's first home game in [Oakland](:Oakland%2C_California) was at [Kezar Stadium](:Kezar_Stadium) against the [Houston Oilers](:1960_Houston_Oilers_season) on September 11, 1960, with a 37-22 loss. They played their last game as an Oakland-based club on December 29, 2019, a game which they lost 16-15 to make them finish 3rd in the [AFC West](:AFC_West), eliminate them from playoff contention, and suffer a late-season collapse after starting with a 6-4 record."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
