<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Szekszárd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Szekszárd (Hungarian: [ˈsɛksaːrd], formerly also Szegzárd; Croatian: Seksar; German: Sechshard or Sechsard; Serbian: Сексард) is a small city in southern Hungary and the capital of Tolna County. By population, Szekszárd is the smallest county capital in Hungary; by area, it is the second-smallest (after Tatabánya)."@en .
