<http://dbpedia.org/resource/PFC_Krylia_Sovetov_Samara> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "PFC Krylia Sovetov Samara (Russian: Профессиональный футбольный клуб «Крылья Советов» Самара) is a football club from Russia based in Samara. It returned to the Russian Premier League for the 2021–22 season. In 2004, they finished third in the Russian Premier League."@en .
