<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The University of Georgia (UGA or Georgia) is a public land-grant research university with its main campus in Athens, Georgia. Founded in 1785, it is one of the oldest public universities in the United States. The flagship school of the University System of Georgia, it has been ranked by major institutional rankings among the best public universities in the United States. The University of Georgia's intercollegiate sports teams, commonly known by their Georgia Bulldogs name compete in National Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA) Division I and the Southeastern Conference (SEC)."@en .
