<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dinamo_Riga_(original)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Dinamo Riga** (Template:Lang-lv was a Soviet [ice hockey](:Ice_hockey) club, based in [Riga](:Riga), [Latvia](:Latvia). It was founded in 1946 and disestablished in 1995 as **Pārdaugava Rīga**. In 1949 to 1963 Dinamo Riga was joined with Daugava sports society which was sponsored by Riga's factories [VEF](:VEF) and then [RVR](:R%C4%ABgas_Vagonb%C5%ABves_R%C5%ABpn%C4%ABca)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
