<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ilves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ilves** (Template:IPA-fi; [Finnish](:Finnish_language) for \"[Lynx](:Eurasian_lynx)\") is a [Finnish](:Finland) professional [ice hockey](:Ice_hockey) team based in [Tampere](:Tampere). They play in the [Liiga](:Liiga) at the [Tampere Deck Arena](:Tampere_Deck_Arena).The colors of Ilves, green, yellow, and black, were taken from what was then the [coat of arms](:Coat_of_arms) of the city of Tampere."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
