<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suffolk_County_Cricket_Club> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Suffolk County Cricket Club** is one of twenty [minor](:Minor_counties_of_English_and_Welsh_cricket) [county](:County_cricket) clubs within the domestic [cricket](:Cricket) structure of [England](:England) and [Wales](:Wales). It represents the [historic county](:Historic_counties_of_England) of [Suffolk](:Suffolk).The team is currently a member of the [Minor Counties Championship](:Minor_Counties_Championship) Eastern Division and plays in the [MCCA Knockout Trophy](:MCCA_Knockout_Trophy). Suffolk played [List A](:List_A) matches occasionally from 1966 until 2005 but is not classified as a List A team *per se*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
