<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dundee_F.C.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dundee Football Club is a professional football club based in the city of Dundee, Scotland. Founded in 1893, they are nicknamed \"The Dark Blues\" or \"The Dee\". The club plays its home matches at Dens Park."@en .
