<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oeste_Futebol_Clube> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Oeste Futebol Clube, commonly referred to as simply Oeste, is a Brazilian association football club based in Barueri, São Paulo. They currently play in the Série D, the fourth tier of Brazilian football, as well as in the Campeonato Paulista Série A2, the second division of the São Paulo state football league. Originally from Itápolis in São Paulo state, Oeste was founded on January 25, 1921. They play in black and red shirts, black shorts and red socks."@en .
