<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cheltenham_Town_F.C.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cheltenham Town Football Club is a professional association football club based in the town of Cheltenham, Gloucestershire, England. From the 2021–22 season, the club compete in League One, the third tier of the English football league system, after winning the League Two title. Nicknamed the \"Robins\", they have played at Whaddon Road since 1932. The club contests rivalries with Gloucester City and Forest Green Rovers."@en .
