<http://dbpedia.org/resource/HPK> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hämeenlinnan Pallokerho** (**HPK**) is a professional [ice hockey](:Ice_hockey) team in the [Liiga](:Liiga), the top men's ice hockey league in [Finland](:Finland). Their [home ice](:Home_Ice) is the [Ritari-areena](:H%C3%A4meenlinnan_j%C3%A4%C3%A4halli) in [Hämeenlinna](:H%C3%A4meenlinna). HPK was established in [1929](:1929_in_sports). The [parent club](:Parent_organisation) of the team is HPK Edustusjääkiekko [ry](:Registered_association_%28Finland%29) and the team is sometimes promoted as the \"Hockey Playing Knights,\" with a logo representing a knight's helmet. HPK won their first [SM-liiga championship](:Kanada-malja) in 2006 and the second in 2019."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
