<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kelly_Bates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kelly Bates** (born July 27, 1975) is the [offensive line coach](:Offensive_line_coach) for the [BC Lions](:BC_Lions) of the [Canadian Football League](:Canadian_Football_League) (CFL). He is a former professional [Canadian football](:Canadian_football) [guard](:Guard_%28American_football%29) and former [head coach](:Head_coach) of the [Simon Fraser Clan](:Simon_Fraser_Clan_football). He was drafted by the Lions in fourth round of the [2001 CFL Draft](:2001_CFL_Draft). He played [CIS football](:CIS_football) for the University of [Saskatchewan Huskies](:Saskatchewan_Huskies_football_team)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
