<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Brynäs_IF> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Brynäs IF** is a [Swedish](:Sweden) [ice hockey](:Ice_hockey) team from [Gävle](:G%C3%A4vle). The club currently plays in the [Swedish Hockey League](:Swedish_Hockey_League) (SHL), the top tier of [ice hockey in Sweden](:Ice_hockey_in_Sweden). The club has played in the top-tier league since 1960, longer than any other team."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
