<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bristol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bristol (/ˈbrɪstəl/) is a city, ceremonial county and unitary authority in England. Situated on the River Avon, it is bordered by the ceremonial counties of Gloucestershire to the north and Somerset to the south. Bristol is the most populous city in South West England.The wider Bristol Built-up Area is the eleventh most populous urban area in the United Kingdom. Bristol was named the best city in Britain in which to live in 2014 and 2017; it won the European Green Capital Award in 2015."@en .
