<http://dbpedia.org/resource/FK_Pohronie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "FK Pohronie is a Slovak football team, based in the town of Žiar nad Hronom. The club currently competes 2. Liga. The 2019/20 season was the first time in the club's history that the team played in Fortuna Liga, the highest level of the Slovak football league system. The club avoided relegation that season and continue in the top division for the 2020/21 season until 2021/22 season when the team was relegated."@en .
