<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bedfordshire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bedfordshire (/ˈbɛdfərdʃɪər, -ʃər/; abbreviated Beds) is a ceremonial county in the East of England. The county has been administered by three unitary authorities: Borough of Bedford, Central Bedfordshire and Borough of Luton, ever since Bedfordshire County Council was abolished in 2009."@en .
