<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jacques-Henri_Brunet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Jacques-Henri Brunet** is a [Central African Republic](:Central_African_Republic) [Olympic](:Olympic_Games) [hurdler](:Hurdling). He represented his country in the [men's 400 metres hurdles](:Athletics_at_the_1992_Summer_Olympics_%E2%80%93_Men%27s_400_metres_hurdles) at the [1992 Summer Olympics](:1992_Summer_Olympics). His time was a 52.59 in the hurdles. He is the [Central African Republic record](:List_of_Central_African_Republic_records_in_athletics) holder in the [110 metres hurdles](:110_metres_hurdles) with a time of 14.76 seconds."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
