<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Colton,_California> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Colton is a city in San Bernardino County, California, United States. Nicknamed \"Hub City\", Colton is located in the Inland Empire region of the state and is a suburb of San Bernardino, approximately 4 miles (6.4 km) south of the city's downtown. The population of Colton is 52,154 according to the 2010 census, up from 47,662 at the 2000 census."@en .
