<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Birgit_Wientzek_Pläge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Birgit Wientzek Pläge** (born 5 May 1971) is a Swiss dressage rider and trainer. She competed at the World Equestrian Games in Tryon 2018 and at four [European Dressage Championships](:European_Dressage_Championships) (in 2003, 2015, 2019 and 2021). She earned a quota place for Switzerland to send an individual rider for the [Olympic Games](:2020_Olympic_Games) in Tokyo, but was not eventually selected to compete.Her husband [Christian Pläge](:Christian_Pl%C3%A4ge) competed at the [2004 Olympic Games](:2004_Olympic_Games) in Athens."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
